## SQ-PL-01 | tableware in the coaster tags
@group A
@commands Boot; `/dumptags item`; check `brewinandchewin:placeable_on_coaster` and `creativedelight:placeable_on_coaster` hold `handcrafted:wood_cup`, `fantasyfurniture:decorations/tankards_milk`, `supplementaries:goblet`; `[placeable]` line in the server log
@pass all three in both tags; `[placeable] ... placeable_on_coaster=365` (2026-11-22 catalog, less items of absent mods) and no `not item ids` warning
@fails member scripts for handcrafted / fantasyfurniture / supplementaries not loaded (requires header), or the item_dict keys missing (Creative Common not rebuilt)
> dumptags item
waitlog \[dumptags\] wrote
shell python3 -I -c "import json; d=json.load(open('kubejs/exported/tags/item_tags.json')); ids=('handcrafted:wood_cup','fantasyfurniture:decorations/tankards_milk','supplementaries:goblet'); [print(t, [i for i in ids if i in d.get(t, [])]) for t in ('brewinandchewin:placeable_on_coaster','creativedelight:placeable_on_coaster')]"
shell grep -h "\[placeable\]" logs/kubejs/server.log | tail -3; true
look both tags list all three items; the [placeable] counts line has placeable_on_coaster near 365 and no warning

## CQ-PL-02 | cup, tankard and goblet drawn on a coaster
@group A
@commands Place a Brewin' coaster; right click it with a Wood Cup, Milk Tankards, a Goblet and a Venthyr Tea Cups; hover a Wood Cup and a Handcrafted plate
@pass each sits on the coaster as its own small 3D model (not a flat sprite), four slots; right click takes them back; Wood Cup tooltip says "Placeable on a coaster"; the plate has no placeable line and the coaster refuses it
@fails flat sprite = coaster file not in the Creative Brewing jar; refused = tag missing; no tooltip line = placeable tooltip reader
@draft client row: steps written by the next client runner
